WEBVTT

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:29.980
Thank you.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.320
94 out of that car.

00:03:34.412 --> 00:03:35.992
You look after Tom, I'll get the girl.

00:03:39.692 --> 00:03:40.412
Are you all right, Tom?

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:44.724
Yeah.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:45.940
Let's get the road.

00:03:50.444 --> 00:03:50.704
Ooh.

00:03:52.044 --> 00:03:52.884
Ooh.

00:03:53.292 --> 00:03:54.292
Here she is!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:03.750
Is she badly hurt?

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:04.590
I think she is.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:07.480
You better get her to the doctor.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.220
Come on, we can get it now.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:50.810
Lucky for us, the X-94 didn't explode.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:51.710
Hurry up, start it.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:53.580
Hope we get her out of here.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.000
You're all right. Take it easy.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:37.570
There's a car.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.710
Never mind a car. Are you all right?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.040
But the men, and they...

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.730
The what? Stop the car!

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.210
Where did you find this car?

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.830
And what was those men chasing you for?

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:58.460
At Old Indian Cave. They were loading it with sacks

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.980
filled with something they called.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.570
Well, X-94, so I ran away with their car.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.780
You should have been taking a chance like that.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.160
But I had to get those sacks to you.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.550
Why, there's enough explosives there to blow you in that car to bits.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:13.430
Oh.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:14.880
It's sure risky.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:18.110
Risky? That's the stuff I want for evidence.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.160
To show why someone is trying to drive the Indians off the reservation.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.660
We were headed to the cave together.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.090
Then somebody warned them that you were coming.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.490
I couldn't hear what they said over the phone, but...

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.770
Phone? Have they got a phone in the cave?

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:37.100
yes that's just the meat that i've been waiting for turn the car on we're going to the cage

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.620
Where is that phone?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.570
It was over there, somewhere.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.860
Sure, this is not.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.420
Here it is, Ruth.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.940
Here's your chicken phone, Ruth.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.380
What do you think of it?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:46.080
Hmm.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.620
Looks like we're bucking a mighty smart homie.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.080
Smart, all right.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.740
Keep his hand this side.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.960
The fellow we're after is on the other end of this line.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.840
And there's the button that'll put his voice on the wire.

00:07:59.170 --> 00:07:59.830
Not so fast.

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:02.650
If we tip ourselves off, we'll never get him.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.080
Then what are you planning to do?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.550
Buy another receiver set like this one.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.390
Rogers, you and Burnett,

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.660
stay here and press that button at 2 o'clock,

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.380
and I'll be on the other end to receive it.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.620
But where will that be?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.130
Zara off's ranch.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.090
Zara?

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:19.240
Yes.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.870
For weeks, I've had a hunt that he's responsible

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.230
for the attacks on these Indians,

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:24.910
and now we're going to prove it.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.430
But how are you going to get him to his place?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:27.730
When he isn't there.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:29.980
You boys stay here and...

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.390
Press that button, Bruce and I will do the rest.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.880
Yes, for you, Mr. Zaroff, it's Vining.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:53.850
Yes, Vining, what is it?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.710
Well, you got the X-94 to jam the store.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:08:59.690
All right, keep your eyes open.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.470
And we'll get it out of there tonight.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.620
The Indian girl has found out about that cave.

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:35.390
Fortune waiting me, my hands tied by that interfering ranger.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:39.320
There's Morgan now.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.810
What do you suppose brings him here?

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:51.650
Well, you won't find out standing there.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.380
Get back to the laboratory, Metzger.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.210
If I ring, you'll know what to do.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:57.550
Right.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.640
It's been an accident, Darroff.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:11.440
The girl's been ahead.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:12.880
I'm sorry to hear it, but, uh...

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.300
Looks like she's been thrown out of a car.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.500
We'd better get her to a doctor.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.760
Of course. I'll phone Dr. Buck.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.120
No. That won't be quick enough.

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:19.530
Better take her in your car.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:20.930
By all means, Morgan.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:21.630
Go right ahead.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.430
I'll join you as soon as I get my hat.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.100
Why did you let me drive her?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.200
Because he's trying to put something over,

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:36.260
and I wanted to think I fell for it.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.550
You'll hear from me later.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:25.060
You gather to the doctor. I'll follow on Tony.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:13.680
Fifteen minutes more.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.500
And we'll know if Zaroff is the man we're after.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:28.920
No danger.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:29.970
Just the boss.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.520
Let him in.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.650
Everything's all set, Mr. Barrow.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:38.680
We've got the Stax Eviction 94 hidden behind the counter.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:40.560
They're ready to go when you want them.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:41.720
Never mind that. I got the phone.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.790
The phone in there was taken out when the store was closed.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.890
We've been using one down the street.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.240
Got to call Carlton at the ranch.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:52.680
Come on.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.420
Easy there, Carlton.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:08.860
Talk it.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:11.800
The show and give the right answer.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.810
Is that you, Carlton?

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:20.930
Yes, the girl's all right.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:22.150
The doctor's looking after her now.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.880
Any important messages for me?

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:27.910
Messages?

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:29.960
Why, uh...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.850
Yes, that, uh, oil man.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:34.770
What's that again?

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:40.470
That oil man is sending our supplies.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.860
They'll call you again sometime.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:49.160
Calls in trouble.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:54.270
Oil man's sending our supplies.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.050
Tom SOS.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:59.850
Yes, I suspected a trick.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.920
Tom Morgan's at my ranch.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:02.780
Come with me.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.380
You can't break in here, Morgan.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.100
What do you think you're after?

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.850
Now, and I'm going to get him.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.560
Come on, Carlton.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.120
Quit calling.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.980
Show me where that wireless phone is to the cave.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:22.430
If there's a wireless phone here, I don't know anything about it.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:52.780
In exactly five minutes, there's a phone call coming in from the cave.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.520
You're wrong, Morgan. There's no wireless phone here.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.700
That's your story.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:02.300
Panda!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.710
You suppose Tom's in trouble?

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:03.150
I know.

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.120
Marvin, you're done.
